1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,440
好了 找到你们了
Okay. Found you.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,680
头等舱有一个空座
I do have an open seat in first class,

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,080
如果你们其中一人愿意免费升舱的话
if one of you would like a free upgrade.

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,940
不用了 谢谢 我们要坐在一起
No, thank you. I think we'll sit together.

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,900
在我们度过了美满的周末后
After the amazing weekend we just had --

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,740
给我吧
I'll take it.

7
00:00:12,027 --> 00:00:13,640
那座位是我应得的
I deserved that seat.

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,714
和菲尔的前拉拉队死党们
Three days in the woods with

9
00:00:14,714 --> 00:00:16,240
在丛林里共度了三天
Phil's ex-cheerleader buddies --

10
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,260
听老掉牙的故事
the old stories,

11
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,979
看他们自发地叠罗汉
the spontaneous human pyramids,

12
00:00:18,979 --> 00:00:21,800
还不停地在Tumblr上发翻跟头的照片
constantly updating their tumbler Tumblr --

13
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,880
我全程陪笑
I smiled through the whole thing.

14
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,620
但问题是我演得太好了
Problem is I was so convincing,

15
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,060
菲尔觉得我是真的很开心
Phil thought I was having a great time.

16
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,400
我想要什么呢 颁个奖吧
What do I want? Some credit.

17
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,380
什么时候要呢 就现在吧
When do I want it? Now.

18
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,800
很抱歉我一身营火味
I'm sorry if I smell like a campfire.

19
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,280
我在丛林里待三天了
I've been in the woods for three days.

20
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,360
我讨厌野营
I hate camping.

21
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,500
我要是在丛林里待了三天
If I'm ever in the woods for three days,

22
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,020
那意味着我已经死了两天了
it means I've been dead for two of them.

23
00:00:49,933 --> 00:00:51,865
发自内心地笑感觉太好了
It feels good to laugh for real.

24
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,440
你看起来需要喝点酒啊
You look like you need a drink.

25
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,000
亲爱的
Hon?

26
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,980
给我的朋友拿两杯霞多丽和一条热毛巾
Two chardonnays and a hot towel for my friend.

27
00:00:59,060 --> 00:00:59,580
马上来
Right away.

28
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,420
我爱你 陌生美女
I love you, beautiful stranger.

29
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,880
不得不承认 我有点生气
I have to admit, I was a little miffed

30
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:07,820
克莱尔居然选择了好座位
that Claire grabbed the good seat,

31
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,760
特别是我刚给她制造了一个魔幻般的周末
especially after I gave her such a magical weekend,

32
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,880
但我决心要保持乐观
but I was determined to stay positive.

33
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:13,160
之后我突然想到[打中了我]
And then it hit me.

34
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:28,380
各位 萨尔到了
Everybody, Sal's here.

35
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,560
-好了 -好了
- Okay. - All right.

36
00:01:29,580 --> 00:01:30,280
条幅"直"吗
Is this straight?

37
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:31,900
你办一个迎婴派对
You're throwing a baby shower

38
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:33,640
邀请了十几个穿着定制西裤
with a dozen men in tailored pants

39
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,437
喝着贝里尼酒的男人
sipping Bellinis.

40
00:01:34,437 --> 00:01:37,280
完全看不出哪里...我都说不出口了
Nothing about this is -- ugh, I can't even finish.

41
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,780
怎么 最后一个词分量太重了吗
Really? The last word was too much?

42
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:41,420
我们决定把死党们聚集起来
So, we decided to get the gang together

43
00:01:41,420 --> 00:01:43,940
给我们的朋友萨尔办一个迟来的迎婴派对
to throw our friend Sal a belated baby shower.

44
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:45,540
她最近比较忙
She's been a little hard to pin down lately,

45
00:01:45,540 --> 00:01:48,160
但我们知道她肯定不愿错过
but we knew she'd never miss the chance

46
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,500
一帮汉子一起送礼[洗澡]的机会
to shower with a bunch of men.

47
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,080
你很爱这个梗是吧
You love that joke, don't you?

48
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,340
因为那是一词多意
Well, because it's two different kinds of showers.

49
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,900
这是小萨米
This is little Sammy.

50
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,120
这也是第一次
This is as long

51
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,580
你来我们家这么久没喝酒
as you've ever been in our house without a cocktail.

52
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:03,680
不了 谢谢 请给我水就行
No, thank you. Just a water, please.

53
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,440
各位 别这么吃惊
Okay, everybody, drop your pearls.

54
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,860
我还在母乳喂养呢
I'm still breastfeeding.

55
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:09,660
书上都说 至少母乳喂养一年
All the books say, "Do it at least a year."

56
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,600
约坦 这杯你喝吧
Jotham, drink this.

57
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:12,780
不行 我得提早离开去看冰球赛
I can't. I'm leaving early to go to a hockey game.

58
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,920
国王对阵黑鹰[音似"黑屌"]
Kings versus Blackhawks.

59
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:16,979
队名还能叫这个吗
They can call a team that?

60
00:02:16,979 --> 00:02:19,066
黑 鹰
Black hawks.

61
00:02:19,855 --> 00:02:21,080
我要把这个放到厨房去
I've got to put this in the kitchen.

62
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,138
所有宝宝食物都是我自己做的
I make all my own baby food.

63
00:02:22,138 --> 00:02:24,103
完全天然 无化学添加
It's all-natural, no chemicals.

64
00:02:24,291 --> 00:02:25,440
这个女人是谁
Uh, who is this woman?

65
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,600
她不喝酒 自己做婴儿食物
She's not drinking, she's making her own baby food.

66
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,240
莉莉还有别的盘子吗
Does Lily have any other plates?

67
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,922
我不能让萨米从塑料餐具里吃饭
I don't let Sammy eat off this plastic.

68
00:02:30,922 --> 00:02:32,150
另外那边的橱柜里
Uh, yeah, the far cabinet.

69
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,380
完全说不通啊
Okay. None of this makes sense.

70
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,140
我知道 她不让宝宝碰塑料的话
I know. How does she breastfeed him

71
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:37,520
她要怎么母乳喂养啊[硅胶]
if she doesn't let him near plastic?

72
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,560
妈 我发烧了吗
Mom, do I have a fever?

73
00:02:41,233 --> 00:02:42,692
我看看
Ay, let me check.

74
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:46,100
我们有体温计啊
You know, we have a thermometer.

75
00:02:47,140 --> 00:02:49,060
你一定要总是这么白人作风吗
Do you have to be so white all the time?

76
00:02:49,606 --> 00:02:52,129
宝贝 快去躺下
Oh, baby, go lay down.

77
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,520
你真是个勇敢的小男孩
You're such a brave, little boy!

78
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:57,300
他装的
He's faking it.

79
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,460
他装病
He's pretending to be sick

80
00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:00,240
为了不去上烹饪课
so he doesn't have to go to his cooking class.

81
00:03:00,340 --> 00:03:01,740
他必须得去 今天教做千层面
He has to go. Today's lasagna.

82
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,920
我饿了一天就等那个了
I've been starving myself all day for that.

83
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,840
他不想去
He doesn't want to go

84
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,980
因为那里有个孩子总捉弄他
because there's a boy there that is picking on him.

85
00:03:07,220 --> 00:03:07,920
烹饪课吗
Cooking class?

86
00:03:08,420 --> 00:03:10,160
我们都不知道能送他去哪里
You know, we're running out of places to send him

87
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:10,860
他会是酷学生了
where he can be cool.

88
00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:13,020
我知道 真的是够了
I know. Enough is enough.

89
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:14,480
你得教他打架
You have to teach him how to fight.

90
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:15,620
对 这管用
Yeah. That'll work.

91
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,780
你去教他
You're doing this.

92
00:03:16,780 --> 00:03:18,720
但别告诉他这是我的主意
And don't tell him that this is coming from me.

93
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:21,287
知道他妈妈觉得他软弱对男孩子不好
It's bad for a boy to know that his mother thinks he's weak.

94
00:03:21,287 --> 00:03:23,120
会让他变成那种花钱找女人
That's a lifetime of paying women

95
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,540
打他屁股的男人
to spank him until he cries.

96
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,100
那孩子天生不会打架
The kid is just not a fighter.

97
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,040
他砸牛肉都小心翼翼的
He gets squeamish pounding veal.

98
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:29,440
教他
Just do it!

99
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,340
好吧 但我教他只是为了千层面
Fine, but I'm only doing it for the lasagna

100
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:33,660
还有他每周日带回来的食物
and the extra food he's been bringing home on Sundays.

101
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,740
这样周一就方便多了
Makes Mondays easier, you know?

102
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:37,340
天呐 你真是加菲猫
Oh, my God, you're the Garfield.

103
00:03:39,060 --> 00:03:40,340
两位美女有谁愿意
One of you pretty ladies

104
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:41,780
一会儿带我去见一个妹子吗
want to take me to meet a girl later?

105
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:44,140
你觉得叫我们美女就有免费车坐吗
You think calling us pretty is gonna get you a ride?

106
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,140
我来吧
I'll take it.

107
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,280
你要走的时候告诉我
Let me know when you want to leave.

108
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,820
另外 我喜欢罗思 我觉得她很配你
Besides, I like Rose. I think she's good for you.

109
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,520
是另一个姑娘 莎拉
This is a new girl -- Sarah.

110
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,800
我受够罗思了 她很神经
I'm done with Rose. She crazy.

111
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:53,940
慢着 花花公子
Easy, Macklemore.

112
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:55,060
你说"神经"是什么意思
What do you mean, "crazy"?

113
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:56,400
我告诉你他什么意思
I'll tell you what he means.

114
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,520
女人在任何方面挑战了男人
Any time a woman challenges a man in any way,

115
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,940
她就成了神经病
suddenly, she's crazy.

116
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:03,240
她做了什么神经病的事 卢克
So, what did she do that was so crazy, Luke --

117
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:04,100
跟你说了她的建议吗
Give you her opinion?

118
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:07,860
是啊 或者 她竟敢谈她的感受
Yeah, or what, did she dare to talk about her feelings?

119
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,680
听起来你们好像是懂我了
The words sound like you get it,

120
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,140
但你们的口气却像在批评我
but your tone is throwing me.

121
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:13,220
拜托告诉我你分手时说了几句好听的
Just tell me you said something nice when you broke up with her.

122
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:14,900
我还没跟她分手呢
I haven't broken up with her.

123
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:15,320
什么
What?!

124
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:16,740
打电话给别人
It just seems weird

125
00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:18,620
告诉他们坏消息 感觉有些奇怪
to call someone up and give them bad news.

126
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,240
她总会知道的
She'll find out somehow.

127
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:22,840
你什么时候成了男人 好恶心
Ugh. Ugh, when did you become a guy? It's gross.

128
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:24,980
你得勇敢地面对她
You need to stand up and face her.

129
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:25,680
当面吗
In person?

130
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,460
我们30岁了吗 给她发短信啊
What are we, 30? Send her a text.

131
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,180
你得温柔地告诉她
You need to break it to her gently.

132
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:30,880
首先 告诉她她超棒
First, tell her she's awesome.

133
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:31,580
而且好漂亮
And pretty.

134
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:32,840
如果她超棒而且漂亮
If she was awesome and pretty,

135
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,880
我根本不会甩了她
I wouldn't be dumping her.

136
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,200
照做 你个蠢猪
Just do it, you pig.

137
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,320
我们都知道我不会那样做
We all know I'm not gonna do it,

138
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,530
如果你们想要这样 给
so if you want it done, here.

139
00:04:42,180 --> 00:04:44,820
别偷窥我的手机
Oh, and don't go looking around on there.

140
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,680
不会让你们更喜欢我的
It's not gonna make you like me more.

141
00:04:57,981 --> 00:04:59,520
抱歉 我觉得你坐了我的位置
's-scuse me. I think you're in my seat.

142
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,920
先生 我们觉得你坐了她的位置
Sir, we think you're in her seat.

143
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:03,180
不 我绝对是坐16C
No, I'm definitely 16c.

144
00:05:03,820 --> 00:05:05,040
这是19C
This is 19c.

145
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,700
该死 应该是往前三排
Oh, darn it, that's three rows up.

146
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:07,940
对不起
Sorry about that.

147
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:08,560
没事
That's all right.

148
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,110
欢迎
Hi. Welcome.

149
00:05:11,110 --> 00:05:12,193
你能等会儿再坐吗
Um, could you hang back a second?

150
00:05:12,193 --> 00:05:13,183
我手机掉了
I-I dropped my phone.

151
00:05:13,183 --> 00:05:15,909
我也许有你想找的东西
I may have, uh, what you're looking for...

152
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:18,420
-在这里 -等等 什么
- Right there. - Wait. What?

153
00:05:19,091 --> 00:05:21,074
你好 我是职业魔术师
Hi. I'm a professional magician.

154
00:05:21,074 --> 00:05:23,314
老天爷啊 你是爱德华·罗格朗
Holy sword-box, you're Edward LeGrand.

155
00:05:23,314 --> 00:05:24,079
是的 正是在下
Yeah, I am. I am.

156
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,121
我是菲尔·邓菲
I-I'm Phil Dunphy,

157
00:05:25,121 --> 00:05:27,197
职业房地产经纪人 业余魔术师
p-professional realtor, amateur magician.

158
00:05:27,197 --> 00:05:28,880
-很高兴认识你 -你好 我是吉莉安
- Well, nice to meet you. - Hi. I'm Jillian.

159
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:30,200
别人说我有魔法之手
I've been told I have magic hands.

160
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:31,960
我是按摩师
I'm a masseuse.

161
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,780
你为什么一直揉前臂
Why do you keep rubbing your forearm like that?

162
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:36,417
-有个行李箱砸到我了 -让我看看
- Oh, I-I had a suitcase land on me. - Oh, let me see.

163
00:05:36,558 --> 00:05:37,100
菲尔
Hey, Phil... ohh.

164
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:38,840
我有个新魔术想表演给你看
...I've got a great new trick I want to show you.

165
00:05:39,547 --> 00:05:41,339
我也可以表演魔术
Oh! Ooh, I can do tricks, too.

166
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:42,920
这地方联系着你的舌头
This spot's connected to your tongue.

167
00:05:45,863 --> 00:05:47,252
需要我帮你放好包包吗
Can I stow your bag for you?

168
00:05:48,188 --> 00:05:49,644
不 我们会需要的
Mm. No, we'll be needing this.

169
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,680
八卦杂志
Trashy magazines.

170
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:53,320
你最好了
Oh, you're the best.

171
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:55,109
焦糖巧克力
Ooh. Caramel truffles.

172
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:58,500
我还多带了一个松软的颈枕
I even brought an extra fluffy neck pillow.

173
00:06:00,140 --> 00:06:03,660
母亲的拥抱肯定就是这种感觉
Oh, this must be what a mother's hug feels like.

174
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:05,720
喂
Hello?

175
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,640
看来她把你照顾得很好
Well, it looks like she's taking good care of you.

176
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:10,260
她是我最好的朋友
Well, she is my best friend.

177
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,619
听我说 胡里奥
Listen to me, Julio.

178
00:06:11,619 --> 00:06:15,320
我要你今天清理好水沟 不是明天[西语]
I want the gutters cleaned today, not manana.

179
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,920
如果人们都认为我们国家的人很懒
If everyone thought my people were lazy,

180
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:20,700
我会尽一切努力表现得勤奋
I would do whatever it took to not seem lazy.

181
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:21,860
明白了吗
Comprende?

182
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,980
实际上我们很快就要起飞了
Actually, we're gonna take off soon,

183
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:26,660
所以我们需要你关掉手机
so we're gonna need you to turn off your phone.

184
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:29,240
我还没说完呢 再来两杯
I'm actually not done talking, and two more.

185
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,760
如果我是你
Well, if I were you,

186
00:06:30,860 --> 00:06:33,420
我会放下玉米煎饼 爬上梯子
I'd put down the burrito and get up that ladder.

187
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:37,580
你怎么还站在这里
What are you doing standing there

188
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:39,800
不给我和我的闺蜜克莱尔拿酒啊
and not getting drinks for me and my good friend, Claire?

189
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:41,720
实际上我们刚见面
Actually, we just met.

190
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:45,199
两位
Oh, guys, guys,

191
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:48,258
我不能让你们俩打扫
I can't let you do the cleanup all by yourselves.

192
00:06:48,258 --> 00:06:49,460
罗纳多会帮忙
Ronaldo will help you.

193
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,100
当然啦
Of course!

194
00:06:50,606 --> 00:06:51,660
萨尔在哪里
Uh, where is Sal?

195
00:06:51,660 --> 00:06:53,980
我需要她的钥匙 好把礼物搬上她的车
I need her keys to start loading the gifts in her car.

196
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,880
她好像在我们房间里给萨米换尿布
I think she's changing Sammy in our room.

197
00:06:56,235 --> 00:06:58,544
希望她把窗帘也换了
I hope she's also changing those drapes. Oh!

198
00:06:58,955 --> 00:07:00,820
我不想听起来像是个多愁善感的人
I don't want to sound like a sentimental softy,

199
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:01,900
但有谁想念
but does anyone miss

200
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:03,720
过去的那个醉婊子吗
the drunken whore she used to be?

201
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:05,380
我喜欢新的萨尔
Oh, I like the new Sal.

202
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,780
原来只需要一个小宝宝 她的母性本能
Turns out, all she needed to bring out her maternal instinct

203
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:08,497
就焕发出来了
was a little baby.

204
00:07:08,497 --> 00:07:10,840
我不信 不 有什么不对劲
I don't buy it. No, something's up.

205
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:13,260
你记得她建议我们把莉莉淹死在海里吧
You do remember her suggesting we chuck Lily into the ocean.

206
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,260
米奇尔 冷静点 宝宝会让人改变
Oh, Mitchell, calm down. Babies change people.

207
00:07:15,260 --> 00:07:16,940
你以前是个愤世嫉俗的评判者
Like you used to be a judgmental cynic,

208
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:19,080
然后莉莉... 等等
and then Lily -- oh, wait.

209
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,540
萨尔没在那里
You guys, Sal's not back there.

210
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:23,700
-萨尔 -窗帘还在
- Sal? - The drapes still are.

211
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:25,140
真奇怪 她的车不见了
Well, that's weird. Her car's gone.

212
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:25,600
什么
What?!

213
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:27,320
别太快下结论
Let's not jump to conclusions.

214
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,640
在这片地区 她的车可能是被偷了
In this neighborhood, her car could have been stolen.

215
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,249
她看起来的确有些疲惫
Well, you know, she did seem frazzled.

216
00:07:31,249 --> 00:07:32,900
也许她忘记说再见了
May-- maybe she forgot to say goodbye.

217
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:34,560
忘了她的所有礼物吗
Oh, and forgot all of her presents.

218
00:07:37,780 --> 00:07:39,320
忘了她的宝宝
And forgot her baby.

219
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:41,220
你们不会觉得她...
You don't think that there's any way that she would --

220
00:07:41,425 --> 00:07:42,005
不
N-no.

221
00:07:42,005 --> 00:07:43,622
我都说不出口
I-I can't even say it.

222
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:44,339
我可以
I can.

223
00:07:44,339 --> 00:07:46,980
女酒鬼抛弃了私生子
That gin-soaked tart abandoned the little bastard.

224
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,120
干什么 他没有父亲
What? He's fatherless.

225
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,560
我说错了吗
Am I wrong?

226
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:57,460
我给萨尔打了五次电话
Okay, I've called Sal five times,

227
00:07:57,460 --> 00:07:58,500
她还是没接
and she still hasn't picked up.

228
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:00,460
我就知道"大地母亲"什么的是一场戏
I knew this whole "Earth mother" thing was an act.

229
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:03,100
当我们指责一位母亲
Oh, maybe we should use our happy voices

230
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:04,500
抛弃了她的小宝宝时
when we're accusing a mommy

231
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:06,280
我们也许该用快乐的声音
of abandoning her little baby boy.

232
00:08:06,961 --> 00:08:09,280
-这真是一场灾难 -不是吗
- Ugh. This is a true disaster. - Isn't it?

233
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,460
有人把西班牙式屋顶
Someone put a Spanish roof

234
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:12,920
盖在了中世纪农场式别墅上
on what is clearly a mid-century ranch.

235
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,749
不好
Oh, no.

236
00:08:13,749 --> 00:08:15,572
有人刚拉屎了
Someone just went numero two.

237
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,160
余震依然绵绵不断
And the aftershocks are still rolling in.

238
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,682
这是她的尿布包 这是...
Here's her diaper bag. And...what's --

239
00:08:22,224 --> 00:08:23,980
等等 这里有张字条
Oh, no. This, here's a note.

240
00:08:23,980 --> 00:08:25,400
很抱歉以这样的方式离开
"I'm sorry to leave this way.

241
00:08:25,740 --> 00:08:26,520
我并不感到自豪
I'm not proud of it,

242
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,060
但我真的受不了了
but I just can't do this anymore.

243
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:28,960
再见 萨尔
Goodbye. Sal."

244
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:30,680
越来越难
It's getting harder and harder

245
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:33,140
不把这事往坏处想了
to keep a positive spin on this.

246
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:37,398
吃点奶酪吧
Here. Have some cheese.

247
00:08:37,398 --> 00:08:40,061
不了 谢谢 我不吃
Oh, no. Thank you. I’m, I’m good.

248
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,140
天呐
Oh, my.

249
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,720
这味道还真重
That is strong.

250
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,620
天呐
Oh, my goodness.

251
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:47,600
看什么看
Hey. What are you staring at?

252
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:49,040
这可是法式奶酪
It's French cheese.

253
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:51,280
你一周的薪水都买不起
Costs more than you make in a week.

254
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,240
你最好小声点
Okay, you might want to keep your voice down.

255
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:54,760
-克莱尔 -怎么了
- Claire. - Yeah?

256
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,100
那边的帅哥在对你放电
That guy over there is checking you out!

257
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,380
我觉得他不是
I don't think he is.

258
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:02,020
我朋友克莱尔想在卫生间和你相会
My friend Claire would like to meet you in the bathroom.

259
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:04,338
我没那么说
No. I-I did not say that.

260
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,840
克莱尔 你为什么要这样糟蹋自己
Claire, why do you do that to yourself?

261
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,980
你这么漂亮
You are so pretty.

262
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,260
菲尔 几点了
Hey, Phil, what time is it?

263
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,000
怎么了
What's wrong?

264
00:09:12,420 --> 00:09:14,440
我的手表不见了 爱德华
My watch is gone, Edward,

265
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,960
你做了什么
what did you do?

266
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,920
吉莉安 你中间名的开头是什么
Jillian, what's your middle initial?

267
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:18,960
C 代表凯瑟琳
"C," For Catherine.

268
00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:22,479
菲尔 你第一次跟女生接吻是什么时候
And, Phil, what age were you when you first kissed a girl?

269
00:09:22,479 --> 00:09:24,282
12岁和表妹 14岁和不是表妹的女生
12 cousin, 14 non-cousin.

270
00:09:24,282 --> 00:09:26,400
从不是表妹的那个算起吧
Let's stick with non-cousin.

271
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:29,940
如果你去到那边的14C座位
I think if you go to 14c, seat right over there,

272
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,040
你会找到你想要的[上发条]
you'll wind up with what you're looking for.

273
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,280
我的表是电池表
It works on battery,

274
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:35,300
不过我好激动
but, oh, my God, I'm excited!

275
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:39,968
借过
Excuse me.

276
00:09:39,968 --> 00:09:41,600
-菲尔 是我 -是你啊
- Phil. It's me. - Oh, hey.

277
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,880
-你在这做什么 -我需要逃离
- What are you doing back here? - I need a break

278
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,141
坐在我旁边的那个女人
from the woman I'm sitting next to up there.

279
00:09:44,141 --> 00:09:46,400
-她是世界上最糟糕的人 -真遗憾
- She is the worst person on earth. - I’m sorry.

280
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:48,946
我想她对你可能不会这么咄咄逼人
I was hoping she might be a little less aggressive with you.

281
00:09:48,946 --> 00:09:50,500
你愿意跟我换一下座位吗
Do you mind switching with me for a little while?

282
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:51,436
亲爱的 你不会想跟我换的
Oh, honey, you don't want to.

283
00:09:51,436 --> 00:09:52,580
这里简直是地狱
It's hell back here, too.

284
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:54,080
我左边坐着一位胖女士
I'm squished between this fat lady

285
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,580
一直撞到我的胳膊肘
who keeps digging into my elbow

286
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,140
右边坐着一位汗津津的老兄
and this huge, sweaty dude

287
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:58,960
一直拿自己的工作夸夸其谈
who won't stop blabbing on about his job.

288
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:02,040
能抱一下我吗 我需要一个拥抱
Well, could I get a hug? I could really use one.

289
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,100
没问题 他们让我们回座位了
Sure thing. They want us back in our seats.

290
00:10:04,820 --> 00:10:06,120
我没听到提示声啊
I didn't hear the little ding.

291
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:07,120
你肯定是耳塞了
Your ears must be plugged.

292
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,520
感觉到了吗
Did you feel that?

293
00:10:08,699 --> 00:10:09,820
什么都没感觉到
No, I-I-I didn't feel anything.

294
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:11,580
太恐怖了 你还是回去吧
This is scary. You should go back.

295
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,300
太棒了
Amazing.

296
00:10:20,020 --> 00:10:20,940
谢谢
Thank you.

297
00:10:21,419 --> 00:10:22,203
大魔法师
Sorcerer!

298
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,520
还不错 感受到你的力量了
Not bad. I felt that one.

299
00:10:24,780 --> 00:10:26,040
很不错 曼尼
So good, Manny.

300
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:28,119
这次再用力点
All right, really let one go this time.

301
00:10:28,119 --> 00:10:30,120
想想那家伙让你多么生气
Thinks about how mad this guy makes you.

302
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,399
-他叫什么 -吉迪恩[犹太勇士]
- What's his name? - Gideon.

303
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:31,540
天呐
Oh, geez.

304
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:34,540
想想他对你做了什么
All right, think about what he did to you.

305
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,280
我还是不说了
I'd rather not talk about it.

306
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,640
不知道你傻笑什么 你的茴香都糊了
I don't know why you're smiling. Your fennel's burnt.

307
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:41,660
我的奶油南瓜汤就要大功告成了
Whereas I made a perfect butternut squash.

308
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:42,468
你拿的只是黄油而已
That's just butter.

309
00:10:42,468 --> 00:10:44,866
我忘了我要做的是奶油蛋蛋汤
Oh, yeah, I-I totally forgot the nut squash!

310
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:49,340
用力 用力 不错
Snap it. Snap it. Good.

311
00:10:49,552 --> 00:10:51,020
-再来啊 -够了
- More. Good. - I’m done.

312
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:53,040
不打了 不值得
I'm not fighting anymore. It's not worth it.

313
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,760
但你做得很棒啊
But you're doing so good.

314
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,600
就是要先把肩膀转过来
You just have to turn your shoulder first

315
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,680
这样出拳时就能把全身的重量一并送出去
so that you can throw your weight behind your punch.

316
00:10:59,620 --> 00:11:00,520
如果你想的话
If you want.

317
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:02,640
我觉得你已经很威猛了
I already think that you're very tough.

318
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,580
这都是杰的主意
This is all Jay's idea.

319
00:11:04,852 --> 00:11:06,949
好了 继续 让他们看看谁是猛男
All right. Come on, kid. Show them who's boss.

320
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:09,400
不 比起斗殴 我更喜欢走慈爱路线
No. I'm more of a lover than a fighter.

321
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:11,020
反正我的目标是这个
Well, that's the goal, anyway.

322
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:15,060
宝贝 你开心就好
Okay, papi, whatever you decide.

323
00:11:15,060 --> 00:11:16,600
不要让他离开这个房间
Don't let him leave this room!

324
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,900
也许该由你来教他
Maybe you should teach him how to hit.

325
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:21,060
天呐 看这个
Oh, my God. Check it out.

326
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:22,880
罗思收到了你的分手短信 给了回复
Rose got your breakup text and wrote back.

327
00:11:23,260 --> 00:11:23,780
她发火了
She mad.

328
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,480
怎么发火了 把手机给我
What? Give me that.

329
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,680
谢谢你发来史上最蠢的分手短信
"Thanks for the dumbest breakup text ever.

330
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,520
不要夸一个女孩很棒 然后跟她分手
Don't call a girl awesome, then break up with her.

331
00:11:31,580 --> 00:11:33,340
如果我那么好 你为什么还要甩了我
If I'm so great, why'd you dump me?

332
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:35,780
别自以为是了 冷血的禽兽
Get over yourself, you insensitive troll"?

333
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:38,900
她是什么毛病 怎么能这样跟你说话
What is her problem? She can't talk to you like that.

334
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:41,560
不 她是在跟你们说话
She's not. She's talking to you.

335
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,340
真不敢相信我原来还挺喜欢她
I can't believe I ever liked this girl.

336
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,880
我们的短信深情又礼貌
Our text was compassionate and respectful.

337
00:11:46,980 --> 00:11:48,200
哪里蠢了
There was nothing dumb about it.

338
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:49,020
百分之一百万
A million percent.

339
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,260
你在干什么
What are you doing?

340
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:54,900
那个贱人惹到我这个贱人真是失误
This crazy bitch just messed with the wrong crazy bitch.

341
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,060
这不是真的
This is unreal.

342
00:11:58,180 --> 00:11:59,700
我们都知道萨尔有点疯疯癫癫
We always knew Sal was unstable,

343
00:11:59,700 --> 00:12:00,960
但她怎么能做这种事
but how could she do this?

344
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:02,480
我们还不知道她做了什么
We don't know that she's done anything.

345
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:04,780
假设她现在坐在一架
Okay, let's just suppose for a second

346
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:06,560
去往卡波的飞机上
that she's on a plane to Cabo.

347
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,360
然后呢
What then?

348
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:09,320
也许这一切是命中注定
Maybe this is part of a bigger plan.

349
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,020
也许在莉莉之后
You know, maybe the reason

350
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:11,520
我们没有领养别的孩子
we didn't adopt another baby after Lily

351
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:14,580
是因为上帝想让我们收养萨米
was because god wanted us available for Sammy.

352
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:16,980
这个上帝不让我们领养孩子
Who is this god that denies us a baby,

353
00:12:17,020 --> 00:12:18,200
却让一个狂野女怀了孕
then gets a party girl pregnant,

354
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,380
最后抛弃自己的孩子
only to have her desert the baby

355
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:20,540
好让我们能收养他
so that we can finally get one?

356
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:22,580
就是这个上帝让处女怀孕
The same god that impregnated a virgin,

357
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:24,900
让摩西在篮子里顺河漂下
sent Moses down the river in a basket,

358
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,720
让亚伯拉罕杀死自己的儿子
and commanded Abraham to stab his own son.

359
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:30,000
上帝总是对小孩不太好
God only does weird baby stuff.

360
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,100
好吧 我承认
Okay, yes, I'll admit,

361
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:33,958
其实我也想留下这个小家伙
there is part of me that would love to keep this little guy

362
00:12:33,958 --> 00:12:36,140
像萨尔装出来的那样抚养他
and raise him the way Sal was pretending to.

363
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:38,000
没错 也可以给莉莉添个小弟弟
Exactly. Lily could have a baby brother.

364
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,280
但还有制度管着呢
But there are systems in place here.

365
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:40,040
你总不能把他当作
You can't just keep him

366
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,300
一只院子里捡到的兔子留下吧
like a bunny you found in the yard.

367
00:12:41,300 --> 00:12:42,020
那也太扯了
That's crazy.

368
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:45,002
听着 我们讨论过了
Listen, we discussed it,

369
00:12:45,002 --> 00:12:47,235
我们觉得孩子应该给我们
and we think we should take the kid.

370
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,860
我们该给他取啥名
What should we call him?

371
00:12:49,020 --> 00:12:50,840
不确定 但肯定不能叫萨米
Not sure, but definitely not Sammy.

372
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,900
萨米·萨尔茨曼听起来蠢爆了
Sammy Saltzman sounds so silly.

373
00:12:55,540 --> 00:12:57,700
可以用上手洗牌法
We can overhand shuffle,

374
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,780
也可以用鸽尾洗牌法
and we can riffle shuffle...

375
00:13:00,780 --> 00:13:01,880
但你知道吗
But, you know,

376
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:05,030
无论如何都躲不开暴怒的
there is no escape from the angry...

377
00:13:06,620 --> 00:13:07,600
-皇后 -什么
- Queen. - What?

378
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,600
菲尔 你在干什么
Phil. What are you doing?

379
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:12,180
苦中作乐
Making the best of a bad situation?

380
00:13:12,420 --> 00:13:13,669
那女的为什么要揉你肩膀
Why is that woman rubbing your shoulders?

381
00:13:13,669 --> 00:13:15,960
吉莉安是位按摩师
Oh, uh, Jillian is a masseuse,

382
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,320
这位就是大名鼎鼎的爱德华·罗格朗
and this, of course, is Edward LeGrand.

383
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,340
见到你很高兴
Pleasure to meet you.

384
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:22,320
能把黑桃A还我吗
Now, if you could just give me my ace of spades back,

385
00:13:22,580 --> 00:13:23,200
就在你口袋里
it's in your pocket.

386
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:26,180
原来你那么着急回到这个地狱般的座位
This is why you had to race back to your hellish seat --

387
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,360
是为了享受背部按摩和纸牌魔术啊
for back rubs and card tricks?

388
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:30,240
你知不知道我旁边坐着个什么人
Do you have any idea what I'm going through up there?

389
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:32,040
那女的剪了自己的脚趾甲
She clipped her toenails

390
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,600
因为她的"亚洲女人"手法不对
because her "Oriental girl" didn't do it right.

391
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,640
克莱尔 抱歉
Claire, I'm sorry.

392
00:13:36,660 --> 00:13:38,540
但你得检查下口袋
But I need you to check your pocket.

393
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:43,718
我去
Insanity!

394
00:13:43,718 --> 00:13:45,074
谢谢您
Thank you very much.

395
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:47,760
别生我的气啊
Don't be mad at me.

396
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:49,160
是你自己要坐在那的
You're the one who grabbed that seat.

397
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,660
你那么做真的很自私
That was a pretty selfish move.

398
00:13:50,780 --> 00:13:51,800
没错 是我要坐在那的
Yeah, I did grab that seat,

399
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:54,200
因为整个周末我都大公无私
because I spent the entire weekend being selfless,

400
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,580
但你都没谢过我
and you didn't even thank me once.

401
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:56,620
我为什么要谢你
Why would I thank you

402
00:13:56,620 --> 00:13:57,780
我给了你一个超棒的周末
for giving you an awesome weekend?

403
00:13:57,940 --> 00:13:58,340
超棒
Awesome?

404
00:13:58,340 --> 00:14:01,401
你整个周末都在重温
You spent the whole weekend rehashing stories

405
00:14:01,401 --> 00:14:04,320
阿痒 阿锈还有爱爱船的故事
about itchy, rusty, and loveboat.

406
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,400
我怎么可能会觉得这些东西有趣
How is that fun for me?!

407
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,820
这些梗都超好笑好吗
They were always getting into stuff!

408
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,180
我过来想找点安慰
I came back here for some compassion,

409
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:10,640
你却对我撒谎 把我撇在一边
and all you did was lie to me and blow me off

410
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:12,580
跑回来接着享乐
so you could keep having your fun

411
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:14,780
我却只能坐在头等舱煎熬
while I suffer up there in first class!

412
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:16,220
我好同情你
Oh, my heart goes out to you.

413
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,300
去你的吧 克雷斯金[算命大师]
Oh, stick it, Kreskin.

414
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:19,201
老娘旁边坐着个吃奶酪的种族歧视者
I'm sitting next to a cheese-eating racist.

415
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:22,260
对不起 你的牌被撕了
I'm sorry about your card.

416
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:24,980
不用
Don't be.

417
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:26,300
我的...
Son of a...

418
00:14:27,020 --> 00:14:27,620
到了
All right.

419
00:14:27,754 --> 00:14:29,484
我六点回来接你
I'll be back -- pick you up at 6:00.

420
00:14:29,484 --> 00:14:31,137
还记得我怎么教你的吗
Now, remember, what did I teach you?

421
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,780
暴力能解决一切
Violence solves everything,

422
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:34,519
还有别像大力水手似的挥拳
and don't wind my fist up like Popeye.

423
00:14:34,519 --> 00:14:37,000
不是暴力 是自卫
It's not violence. It's self-defense.

424
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,180
你不能任他欺负你
You cannot let this kid keep pushing you around.

425
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:41,140
给我拿出一副恶棍样 走进去
Now, you walk in there like a badass,

426
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:44,140
做出人所未见的美味千层面
and you make the best damn lasagna anybody's ever seen.

427
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:45,540
谢谢您的教导 杰
I appreciate the speech, jay,

428
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:46,880
但我会按照我的方式来处理这事
but I'll handle things my way.

429
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,740
孩子 还有一件事
Kid, one more thing.

430
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,100
别忘了大蒜面包
Don't forget the garlic bread.

431
00:14:52,116 --> 00:14:53,981
-要是没了它 -我懂
- Because without that... i- - I get it.

432
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:57,120
等等 迪尔加多
Hey, Delgado.

433
00:14:59,020 --> 00:14:59,920
曼尼 我跟你说话呢
Manny, I'm talking to you.

434
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:00,800
想要一块这个吗[想打架吗]
You want a piece of this?

435
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:06,240
你这是干嘛
Ow! What was that for?

436
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:07,860
看来是你被我打了
Looks like I gave you a piece of this.

437
00:15:07,940 --> 00:15:08,660
你有病啊
What the hell?

438
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:10,440
我刚问你要不要烤苹果奶酥啊
I was just offering you some apple crumble!

439
00:15:10,740 --> 00:15:12,060
什么 才不是呢
What? You were not.

440
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:15,100
我说真的 上次的事我很内疚
Yes, I was! I felt bad about teasing you.

441
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:15,909
我的心理医生说
My therapist said

442
00:15:15,909 --> 00:15:17,660
我行为失常是因为父母离婚
I was acting out because of my parents' divorce,

443
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:18,840
所以我想跟你和解
so I was trying to be nice.

444
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:22,020
对不起 我不知道
I'm so sorry. I didn't know!

445
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,860
打得好
Good shot, kid!

446
00:15:23,860 --> 00:15:25,660
现在知道别招惹谁了吧 小混球
That'll teach you who to pick on, you punk --

447
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:26,600
离他远点
Not my boy!

448
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,300
他的拳法可是跟高手学的
He learned how to punch from the best.

449
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:29,640
他父母要离婚了
His parents are getting divorced,

450
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:31,520
他做了那些甜点来道歉
and he made me that dessert as an apology.

451
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:34,180
这全都是你妈的主意
This whole thing was your mother's idea.

452
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:41,480
罗纳多 你拿上那个会摇的东西
Ronaldo, you grab the roller thingy, and, uh --

453
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:43,880
我拿那个网眼笼
Oh! I'll grab that big mesh cage.

454
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:45,300
够了 所有人都停手
All right. Everybody, stop.

455
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:47,040
你不能就这么收养一个孩子
You can't just keep a baby

456
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:50,200
跟在院子里捡到的兔子似的
like it's some rabbit you found in the yard.

457
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,140
有制度管着呢
There are systems in place.

458
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:54,800
他今晚总得待在什么地方吧
He has to stay somewhere tonight, no?

459
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,100
没错 待在这不行吗
Yeah, how about right here,

460
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:58,080
我们可是有育儿经验的
because we know how to raise a child?

461
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,080
得了吧
Oh, please.

462
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,259
我们会给他换衣服 喂他吃东西
We'll dress him and feed him,

463
00:16:00,259 --> 00:16:02,432
粑粑什么的可以让肯奇塔处理
and Conchetta can handle the poopy stuff.

464
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:03,660
我给她上了医疗保险呢
I gave her Obamacare.

465
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:04,740
这点事她总该做吧
It's the least she can do.

466
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,497
我们都想给宝宝最好的
We all want what's best for the baby.

467
00:16:06,497 --> 00:16:09,360
你们人不错 但我们有经验
Y-you're very nice people, but we've done this before.

468
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,140
那又怎样 该轮到我们了
So? It's our turn.

469
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:14,180
我想要孩子很久了
I wanted a child for some time now.

470
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:15,740
人家身体马上就不适合养了呢
My biological clock is ticking.

471
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,639
您这说辞也太扯了呢
That's the most ridiculous thing I've ever heard.

472
00:16:17,639 --> 00:16:19,860
-扯吗 我44了 -你才44也挺扯的
- Is it? I'm 44. - Or that is.

473
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:21,200
你个牙尖嘴利的小婊砸
You are one mean lady.

474
00:16:21,420 --> 00:16:23,320
没费利佩我们决不走
We're not leaving without Felipe.

475
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:24,720
行 那你们就留在这吧
Well, then, you're not leaving.

476
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:25,800
留就留
Fine!

477
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:35,700
真的要叫"费利佩"吗
Did we settle on "Felipe"?

478
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:43,860
菲尔
Phil.

479
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:45,400
宝贝 你在这干嘛
Honey, what are you doing?

480
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:46,037
你等下
One second.

481
00:16:46,037 --> 00:16:49,420
我衣橱里有20件皮毛大衣
So, I have 20 fur coats in my closet,

482
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:51,620
但我的朋友里面
but I'm the only one of my friends

483
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:53,480
只有我还会穿那些
who even wears them anymore,

484
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:56,460
你说说到底是谁要绝种了
so you tell me who's endangered.

485
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:59,260
吉莉安在我的座位等着
Jillian's waiting for you in my seat

486
00:16:59,260 --> 00:17:00,300
为你做个背部按摩
to give you a little back rub.

487
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,360
你没必要这么做
You don't have to do this.

488
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,220
你这个周末也没必要那么耐心
You didn't have to be so great this weekend.

489
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:06,020
但你做到了 谢谢你
But you were, so thank you.

490
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:07,940
我应该更早一些感谢你的
And I should have said that earlier.

491
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,860
去享受剩下的旅程吧
Go enjoy the rest of your flight.

492
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:11,920
这边交给我处理
I'll deal with this.

493
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:13,200
"交给你处理"
"Deal with this"?

494
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:15,900
我可是州议员的情妇
I'm a state senator's mistress.

495
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:17,380
你是我的英雄
You're my hero.

496
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,778
进屋前把鞋底蹭干净
Wipe your feet before you come in!

497
00:17:22,778 --> 00:17:24,640
听听 她说的第一句话
Listen to that. First thing out of her mouth,

498
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,819
就是给我们下命令
she's telling us what to do.

499
00:17:25,819 --> 00:17:26,900
一切都要在今天结束
Well, that stops today.

500
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:28,680
我们要强势一点 决不让步
We go in strong. We hold our ground.

501
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,740
要让她知道 我们不再随她摆布了
We let her know she's done pushing us around.

502
00:17:30,752 --> 00:17:33,200
曼尼 你怎么这么早就回来了
Manny, why are you home so early?

503
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,700
你让他翘课吗
Did you let him skip school?

504
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:35,460
不是 妈
No, mom.

505
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:36,840
我被开除了
I was kicked out

506
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:38,980
因为我打了一个被误解的学生
for punching a really misunderstood kid,

507
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:39,763
都是因为你
thanks to you.

508
00:17:39,763 --> 00:17:40,600
因为我吗 什么
Thanks to me? What, did --

509
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:41,700
我都告诉他了
I told him everything.

510
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:42,800
你知道我们意识到了什么吗
And you know what we realized?

511
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:44,900
我们的生活中的确有个欺凌弱小的人
There is a bully in our life,

512
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:45,780
就是你
and it's you.

513
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:49,238
你给我们定规矩 随意指使我们
You make the rules, you boss us around,

514
00:17:49,238 --> 00:17:51,679
-我们不会再忍气吞声了 -没错
- and we're not gonna take it anymore. - Mm. Yeah.

515
00:17:52,252 --> 00:17:53,580
瞧瞧你们两个
Ah, look at you two,

516
00:17:53,580 --> 00:17:55,620
鼓足勇气 来和这个
standing up to the big, scary bully

517
00:17:55,620 --> 00:17:57,800
爱你们 保护你们
that loves you and protects you

518
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:00,180
希望你们安全的大坏蛋对峙
and wants you to be safe in this world.

519
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:05,040
现在你们在我眼中就是两个渺小的男人
You're just tiny, little men to me right now,

520
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:08,140
给我离开这个房子 带着敬意回来
and you need to leave this house and come back with more respect!

521
00:18:08,356 --> 00:18:09,617
还有比萨饼
And a pizza.

522
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,180
怎么
Oh, what?

523
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:13,540
你们要先去看看睫毛膏有没有花掉吗
You need to go first and check on your mascara?

524
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,300
-我们的确需要吃东西 -是的
- We do need to eat. - Yeah.

525
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:16,360
吃比萨饼挺好
I wouldn't mind some pizza.

526
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,540
不要上面带菠萝的
We're not getting any pineapple.

527
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:18,980
要带菠萝的
You are getting pineapple!

528
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:20,480
我们把菠萝都挑出去
We're taking it off our slices.

529
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:22,235
不要浪费食物 杰
Don't waste any food, Jay!

530
00:18:22,235 --> 00:18:23,220
我觉得我们表明了立场
I think we made our point.

531
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:23,480
完全表明了
Totally.

532
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:26,000
我们自己买比萨饼去 在车里吃
We'll get our own pizza -- eat it in the car.

533
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:30,840
给我一个理由
Give me one reason

534
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:32,760
为什么萨米今晚应该留在这里
why Sammy should stay here tonight

535
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:33,540
而不是跟我们走
instead of with us.

536
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:35,480
因为我们有做家长的经验
Because we're experienced parents.

537
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,820
我们有婴儿床
We have a crib!

538
00:18:36,860 --> 00:18:37,968
我们有私家儿科医生
We have a pediatrician.

539
00:18:37,968 --> 00:18:39,320
我们的家对宝宝很安全
Our house is babyproofed.

540
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:41,580
我们的家被《建筑设计文摘》拍摄过
Our house was in Architectural Digest.

541
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,880
罗纳多 省省吧 说那个没用
Ronaldo, please, you're not helping.

542
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:44,068
他们根本没听过那本杂志
They don't know what that is.

543
00:18:44,068 --> 00:18:47,120
你们这个蜗居怎么可能再容下一个孩子呢
How can you even fit another child in this shoe box?

544
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:47,600
你们太穷了
You're poor!

545
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,840
我们有栋漂亮的房子 还有个大院子
We have a beautiful house with a big yard

546
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:51,520
他可以在那里和园丁一起玩球
where he could throw the ball with the gardener.

547
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,202
好吧 听着
Okay, look.

548
00:18:52,202 --> 00:18:54,348
如果有人要收养萨米 那一定是我们
If anybody's gonna adopt Sammy, it's gonna be us.

549
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,539
都不问一下我的意见吗
Whoa! Do I have any say in this?

550
00:18:56,539 --> 00:18:59,560
萨尔 你回来了
Sal! Oh, well, you're back.

551
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:00,860
你们四个在干什么呢
What the hell are you four doing?

552
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:01,620
你离开了派对
You walked out of here

553
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:02,980
什么都没说就把宝宝扔下了
and left your baby without saying a word,

554
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:04,460
所以也许应该由我们来问你
so maybe we'll be asking the questions.

555
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:06,460
我跟约翰·约翰说了我要去哪里
I told John John where I was going.

556
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:07,560
派对上醉得最厉害的那个家伙
The drunkest guy at the party.

557
00:19:07,560 --> 00:19:08,800
抱歉我不想打断
Excuse me for not wanting

558
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,220
你们的激烈辩论
to interrupt your fierce debate --

559
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:10,960
威猛先生和那个
"Who's hotter,

560
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:13,128
厕纸包装上印的肌肉男谁更帅
Mr. Clean or the brawny paper towel man?"

561
00:19:13,128 --> 00:19:14,060
-威猛先生 -厕纸肌肉男
- Mr. Clean. - Brawny paper towel guy.

562
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:15,440
不要再吵起来了
We're not going back there.

563
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,360
这还是不能解释你为什么忽然离开
That still doesn't explain why you would leave

564
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,860
你自己的迎婴派对
in the middle of your own baby shower.

565
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,220
约坦提起黑鹰队的时候把我吓到了
I got freaked out when Jotham mentioned the Blackhawks.

566
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:23,040
每次 每次我都听错
Every time. I hear it every time.

567
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:25,160
萨米的父亲是那个球队的
Sammy's dad is on the team, okay?

568
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,420
他不知道萨米的存在
And he didn't know Sammy existed --

569
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:28,460
至少在刚刚我跑过去告诉他之前
At least not until I just went down there

570
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:29,020
他不知道
and I told him.

571
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:30,780
天呐 怎么样 他的反应如何
Oh, gosh. What happened? How did he take it?

572
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,240
原来他是有妇之夫
It turns out he's married.

573
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:33,460
是的 我本可以先在网上查一下他的
Yeah, I could have googled that.

574
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:34,300
所以他指不上了
So he's out.

575
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:37,800
你们觉得我抛弃了自己的宝宝吗
And you thought I deserted my own baby?

576
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:38,569
你的确离开了
You did leave.

577
00:19:38,569 --> 00:19:40,040
还有 这个纸条又是怎么回事
And then what -- what's up with this note, huh?

578
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,580
很抱歉以这样的方式离开
Look -- "I'm sorry to leave this way.

579
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:43,660
我并不感到自豪 但我实在受不了了
I'm not proud of it, but I just can't do this."

580
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:44,698
这个尿布包
This diaper bag

581
00:19:44,698 --> 00:19:47,200
是以前我单身时用过的包包
is just a recycled purse from my single days!

582
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:48,500
里面有很多这样的纸条
I got a lot of these notes lying around

583
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:49,200
以便我迅速甩掉男人们
for quick getaways.

584
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:53,380
你们觉得养孩子这事我做不来 是不是
You guys don't think that I can do this, do you?

585
00:19:53,380 --> 00:19:53,986
不是
No!

586
00:19:53,986 --> 00:19:54,850
-我们一直觉得你能行 -我可没有
- We always thought you could do it. - I certainly don't.

587
00:19:54,850 --> 00:19:56,400
-我们不认为你做不到 -闭嘴
- We don't think you can't do it. - Shut up!

588
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,620
我自己也不认为我能行
I don't think I can do it, either!

589
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:58,860
萨尔
Oh, Sal.

590
00:19:59,894 --> 00:20:01,011
实在
I mean, it's just

591
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:03,780
太艰难了
so hard.

592
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:06,880
他没有爸爸 让我觉得好内疚
I feel so guilty that he doesn't have a dad in the picture.

593
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:08,900
我不知道 我努力把每件事做得完美
I don't know. I'm trying to do everything perfectly.

594
00:20:09,120 --> 00:20:09,820
感觉好累
It's exhausting.

595
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:12,540
而且我有一年没有滚床单了
And I haven't had sex in like a year.

596
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,320
这个小家伙
This little dude --

597
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:23,400
是我生命中唯一一个不能搞砸的事
He's the one thing in my life that I cannot mess up.

598
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:27,660
我只是希望能给他一个父亲
I just wish I could give him a dad.

599
00:20:28,580 --> 00:20:30,180
我们怎么样
Well... what about us?

600
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:33,100
我们可以做萨米的爸爸 我们所有人
We could be Sammy's dad. All of us.

601
00:20:33,520 --> 00:20:34,160
是啊 萨尔 我们爱你
Yeah, Sal, we love you,

602
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,940
我们永远支持你 无论你需要什么
and we're always here for you -- whatever you need.

603
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:38,120
除了七月我们要去卡普里岛
Except we'll be in Capri all of July.

604
00:20:38,780 --> 00:20:39,660
说真的 萨尔
Seriously, Sal,

605
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:41,600
你和萨米永远都不会孤单
you and Sammy will never be alone.

606
00:20:42,100 --> 00:20:43,340
你们真好
You guys are so sweet.

607
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,960
等等 六月也不行
Wait. June's no good, either.

608
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:47,420
我要去整一下我的脖子
I'm getting my neck done.

609
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:53,080
天呐 你们干了什么
Oh my god. What did you do?

610
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:54,560
我们维护了你的尊严
We stuck up for you.

611
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:55,920
没错 罗思自找的
Yeah. Rose had it coming.

612
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,560
她怎么能像我们那样跟你讲话
She can't talk to you the way we do.

613
00:20:57,560 --> 00:20:59,720
罗思把你们的短信转发给了莎拉
Well, Rose forwarded your texts to Sarah.

614
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,740
现在莎拉不愿意跟我约会了
And now Sarah doesn't want to go out with me.

615
00:21:01,820 --> 00:21:02,600
把手机给我
Give me that phone.

616
00:21:02,752 --> 00:21:04,946
那个贱人莎拉说什么了
What did the skank Sarah say to you?

617
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:08,480
哎哟 开头不错
Yeah ouch. Good opening.

618
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:11,780
真幽默 是我们自作自受
So funny. We totally deserve that.

619
00:21:11,860 --> 00:21:13,620
没错 这小姑娘真幽默
Totally. Good sense of humor.

620
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:16,291
-天呐 爱死她了 -我也是
- Oh my god. I love her. - Me too.

621
00:21:16,291 --> 00:21:18,762
别担心 卢克 我们会把她追回来的
Don't worry Luke. We're gonna win her back.

622
00:21:18,762 --> 00:21:20,640
我们只需...
We're just go...

623
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,080
卢克
Luke!

624
00:21:23,500 --> 00:21:25,180
我们是不是应该去找自己的约会对象
You think maybe we need dates of our own?

625
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:25,660
太需要了
So bad.
